+#### 14.2 管理端首页/ECharts 数据读取时序图
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant WEB as 管理端 Vue 首页/ECharts
+    participant REQ as request.js/Axios
+    participant GW as 网关/业务服务
+    participant WC as WorkSpaceController
+    participant RC as ReportController
